WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:08,700
Don't you feel the dust in your back and the tightness in your waist? Uncle Liu

2
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:11,780
My back is sore after doing it for a long time. Besides, how can a child have a waist?

3
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:15,070
Feel this place yourself

4
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:17,190
Is it a bit cooler than others?

5
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:20,390
Uncle Liu, don’t scare me, I’ll ask you

6
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:21,940
Have you seen one?

7
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:22,860
Wear gray long sleeves

8
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:24,020
bloated man

9
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:25,800
how did you know

10
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,640
I also know where he is now, believe it or not?

11
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,400
It's lying on your back

12
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:33,550
Uncle Liu, please get him down quickly. I'm afraid.

13
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:39,750
Get off the child quickly or else

14
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:44,020
Don't blame the old man. I'll do it and I'll count to three.

15
00:00:49,030 --> 00:00:49,950
What are you doing with him?

16
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:55,770
This child has a weak constitution. Why do you want to burn a paper temple? Stop talking nonsense.

17
00:00:55,890 --> 00:00:58,490
What does your death have to do with your child? OK, just go.

18
00:00:59,230 --> 00:01:00,750
I'll call you when I'm burning gold pellets

19
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:06,220
When you come back after the burning, don’t blame me for whipping your Uncle Liu

20
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:07,940
How can you talk to him

21
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:11,180
What on earth are you doing? Go back to bed and don't ask so many questions.
